{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2fd1c8ff6be2d4bcbefbdac945654de50883b1a63d4099b427d6190f88d62c84",
      "text": "In the founding myth, we were\nguided from the Land of Lament to\nthe Farlands.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:419f666586bcbb83b8d543f5b6caf0eb01f1f3cede97792cacc69f61a5bce1a2",
      "text": "So that's the truth behind the\nmyth... We are descendants of\npurged sinners—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:89043429526f8e9d9b88361113e7f3627e7844c0bdeb34b68f8780e683139783",
      "text": "In every age, gods get twisted to\nsuit people's convenience. You knew\nthat already, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "16": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7fcfd0b3eb3ad571037aebe75487039113fde02c5a41938051697c9ab049a361",
      "text": "The god, the dragon, the world...\nThey were broken from the very\nbeginning...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:918d6172d4f39c5147064d23eeb79fe51383df79e879298457a9cbe1b2b6ac96",
      "text": "But honestly, none of that matters.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2919eb6fd63ee6bf0fb53d90cceb81692b7e151f7600bdf4b9572cf199b4114d",
      "text": "Because you don't believe in gods,\ndo you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ba868c54bab5ba0d099662075e3ab5c1cc6ea6b23d79192ef928664bf632099",
      "text": "Nothing ever guided me. All that\nexisted only denied me and hurt me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97c01dd40c3e15182fb7346d5d142339868c8d21ca7a05e24a3a74ccd57dd242",
      "text": "...So we destroy. Cut out everything\nthat warps and stains the light.\nThat's what you wanted, isn't it...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bc41a191034fa6065fd46e7bd7e084d1fc02603e8f8708c52d98309300fe8fed",
      "text": "That's wrong! The Prince is—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:75bead589693d531a4ef395cad9d8e91d38a8662918b9b1c8ff9aff04d124008",
      "text": "The Prince and I are different.\nRight?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bec8578e2e184a42a27f9f877e8508355ecc8325cb95b6419b8b9824abc9e381",
      "text": "All I found by \"talking things out\"\nwith my old man and my brother was a\ngouged-out wound. What they took—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7324c6fdb8e8fd4398ed803a357c1b78ac83f750a19e0a99ce227aaa6dd189e",
      "text": "Shut up!!! Shut up, shut up! Shut\nuuuup!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ef7dca415242e214b8367daebf327ee38459a3b4349e835bb321efc8e8d0dba2",
      "text": "Hurk. Bleeeeegh!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf2c284ae39c90f45fa49e4548a090858c7ee236c8699543b53c7deaf047f302",
      "text": "Haah... Haah... Damn it...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:621f4fdb2b73e702242e3381d7987fa0a609d36f13f611bc707f8e960a1479dd",
      "text": "Shut up. Worthless fool. Are you\ntrying to shame me further...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8415876b0eb6975beed111e4c769210647dbd80d3165ce4ce5a743de65b194d1",
      "text": "Listen. Don't think. You lot just shut\nup and do as you're told. If you've\ngot time to use those tiny brains—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d15e2743546d41885cfe15fd68dc834d7f27a28df9aaf510663e99d201cb793",
      "text": "You're the one... who's lacking...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c577ff72711d22164227257eb5c469bab13ffa633f8a2c4d566ec9b839438056",
      "text": "Who do you think you ARE?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a052f7e84dd5b4b41ce037bf435ae3ef684d9fa6a4f71fce3c66d8bf655eeacd",
      "text": "Because there are people like you\nin this world... I, I—!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b3d4aa535c2924b58cc9c5bb752ab701d4056c9a57bebd0fdb4170cc0367e21",
      "text": "Forgive me... forgive...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e566813d4fa147c68c60b56141e566ba835555997bd52fb0dd981e2bec44826",
      "text": "Oh... He's awake! Sister Corinna!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ca693fbde1deb64361f5435f823354b892043a2f4c7b283d1298e5c69a9bb55",
      "text": "Thank goodness. Um... You're\nMarden, right...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b6d2c7876422f430bca02377f8c77a8eba3b3860ff651db364e34a4c01ef92f8",
      "text": "...Sister?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0926112f2fe650bf5c4ec228febd4f8325c5b46d20b5cb47933ed47038dc4082",
      "text": "Th-this is an orphanage we run.\nStella helps out a lot, too—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b30462db7066bf130fdce5d9bf36917b1fe413d8b306ac7e20674dc751c78293",
      "text": "...I see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7c9f8f8102c8d6a890ab1fd848703319035f1a443b3cb7b5c1058c65ee6333cf",
      "text": "...I'll keep the booze a secret\nfrom the church!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:75407dba48a63bcbb386eb624a505d1d82ca27ef0cea7d6bd8739702bd6022a4",
      "text": "...Sorry.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3aacead88fac52c825482af55f87db01172f074e98a2063837da5f1e748cc947",
      "text": "If you'd like, I could at least\nlisten to you. I'm a sister, even\nif barely!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:19feab64f7f65e9f83732ef247ef66dc6250e969d1854bee205f892009eb8690",
      "text": "...Why.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0fdcf188acd144f48db3a5d59a20e99976e4ffea3e34d2d9d3c1fc0dc1399e4b",
      "text": "Why can you smile like that?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:deda4700d981e4801be471c552c8985b210db606bffbaab33e46811c35c8abcc",
      "text": "Running an orphanage, you can't\nhelp but see it. That the stars'\nguidance doesn't really exist.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8449224d4c6adb96840e2f4b4c07e1d4750e89a50b179ce3134231f404786f51",
      "text": "And yet, why do you...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aaf786f9ae85a0f9d2da94f2beae672ccf3d2b7bb5bee548c9bf7143fdfe80e4",
      "text": "It's embarrassing, but I don't\nactually have all of the Farlana\ndoctrine memorized.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1dab0b50f4a2044f81bea75b0ac603e80c8b62f44e87e970df0684d55ae8c666",
      "text": "I barely finished my priest training\nbefore I was taken in here. But I\nloved the tale of the Guiding Hand.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a8df234b531f31cc4bb2643b54f05c1bb65366b929f4395adc31f57135aabc6e",
      "text": "\"...Though stars hide in a darkened\nsky, I can still reach out my hand.\nSeize the wandering hand...\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3404c962710fd2010f7324857c306ce62c51a6f6c2279535c816974c4cec5f11",
      "text": "Right. Look, you don't have to be a\ngod to reach out a hand, do you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c280f29377d01cb0d207d613868a3901e365d7141b39c75f5712f50039ea3ba8",
      "text": "Waaaah!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c8d0e6b2746b7d7d3a2b28008b266a39ab90e2cef4e22039014fed42c4378b4",
      "text": "E-excuse me for a moment...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e2786059915b3e93a5927a85220d78e653037822cb1b6d1b2839157c6366dce3",
      "text": "Hey! Hans! Come out!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2da81772fd2bc15602240205a23bb8677cbfa51702b35894b2b8de94f34a118c",
      "text": "Shut up! Everyone's a liar! Just\nlike Dad!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c066de11ad952c4feb5898fc22c79db7a597197a7a562a21e0f9c947538395b1",
      "text": "It's his fault... but nobody...\nnobody listens to me...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4c07ae905654bf7b747a2d2299da0fc1289db1814d43117ceb80275e4ffe9220",
      "text": "...Is your dad a liar?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:052048fe8bf6c13927176705947ecc2f8e32e1d91a8c21b66560569ef0e4187e",
      "text": "I'm a priest too, technically. I\ncan listen, if you want...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c166fda46148464d70ea3765e6886b0331f877b2b6545ae9224003896681ead5",
      "text": "...Yeah. Dad never came to pick me\nup! He lied to me...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9637d70740fc52bc44b052543fb59621fdfd65d29ef987a1a7ced92a50a5b3cc",
      "text": "I can't forgive liars...! Even\nfriends!! Never!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:391946fea05a2abc150d5f678e0b9f26fb0100dc049ff5809145ecbf84676b19",
      "text": "...So you're angry at your dad.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:040f64684d0b0f6435be81a81a9a925bae1c480b73ac364ba80d0754540ea73c",
      "text": "Then it's fine. You're allowed to\nbe angry.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7255925f5cf645a2a29974076cb0409170e32f85bbaaffbea034e896d14ae045",
      "text": "But Hans... Isn't that different\nfrom being lonely?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:73d8fc2530509370e153ba6a0e4b0681a84cb80d74edea1e2faec9e869e8c71c",
      "text": "In that case, I should listen to\nyou...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c120f9d11c63f4ad8b570d42c6a182d4816ea1cb18240a92d7f8902c895cfbac",
      "text": "That kid and I are the same.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83b1779e8463e466d5679e96aaa62fb171c451193e1f247965c69a4c9da8eb9d",
      "text": "No, I'm worse. I didn't want to look\nat the wounds my old man and the rest\ngave me, so I ran all the way here.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "196": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ed94222cd34314d5614c2c4b3b5c307eeb83f2d81ecc3429d83c3bfc93a66738",
      "text": "\"Won't get better?\" Please. I just\nhated myself. I tried to kill it in\nthe name of a cause.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ddcc1562ce1ea8b524eb8fbc163c67f77a6602eb51f794df5fa08b0ade2ada1d",
      "text": "...I became the very thing I hate\nmost.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:52fb67789cba18de83d81dca944a332ef689eb6a53bad245b646982da1914766",
      "text": "That's why you wanted to cut it\nout, right? Yourself, the thing\nthat hurts you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2044b3761464abbf7dac9bb130c8e7b0dc800d713a14dae3a4146d3152eb340b",
      "text": "Then I'll devour you. I'll devour\nthe stars. And build a world where\neveryone can walk into the light!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f63f68923aef2f8fc5e2885bced878246017a9e10426495acab60db1b39f79b",
      "text": "Enough already...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "216": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f4e10e68dd30780f21ad8eda872bf3a98334942931dca463ede7359c544577d",
      "text": "...But I need your help.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "220": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c676ea9c433c5657bae898b91df4f3660d4f02346189af2d73b9c4558eaf45b3",
      "text": "I want to be like Sister Corinna.\nThat's exactly who I wanted them to\naccept me as...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "224": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33a198fbd8538170ee582850eec0e88bc03176d5ae8fa7abb79c80978083194f",
      "text": "Please...! Help me become something\nthat simple...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "228": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:afd77e7aa72b349a5b0a433bfa4ed77759eae89b8f6bb241c3035d038d3f358f",
      "text": "I see. Then let's go with that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1719f6c7b5ab32fb9524bd4bfa40836e52c4cec6f6b236ec051a3a0c2ca7195",
      "text": "I understand your wish. So I'll\ngrant it. After all, I'm you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "237": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:01bf1b71dfaf4bfb869d77c8ffcefb4c08cdd593d1a3a6702da3e9c5f1a41510",
      "text": "Ha, haha... Seriously? An honest\nevil god, huh. Never thought I'd\nsee one.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc8e25a5747284d9ed56958bc3012be01dffcbe5a811d52ff8f93509b8fd0110",
      "text": "...I'll call you Lost.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "245": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aee799e5395eb990c2687004a9331c55b6070b5681fb060789885cf55ff4413a",
      "text": "Squeak!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
